{
 "nodes": [
  {"id": "document:packages/client/AGENTS.md", "type": "document", "name": "AGENTS.md", "filePath": "packages/client/AGENTS.md", "summary": "client 组（Web 浏览器栈+apps/web 构建入口）协作规则：slots/props 纪律（两种声明形态、children=声明+授权、五份额派生 props、框架造 hooks、活数据三通道、store 读 useStore 写 actions、inject 只回纯数据回调、Factory 组件稳定身份、key 表身份）。", "tags": ["documentation", "authoring-rules", "web-client"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "document:packages/client/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/client/README.md", "summary": "client 包组 README：dsh Web GUI 的浏览器体验（会话/导航/设置/审批/文件访问等交互特性）——加浏览器可见行为选本家族，服务端页面交付与 host 集成选 host/ 组；含共享浏览器基础与聚焦 UI 特性两层。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-group", "web-client"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/client/connection/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/README.md", "summary": "dsh-client-connection 包 README：承载浏览器→Host 的 Remote 调用、精确 Fetch 应答与连接代际——Client 插件挂 ctx.connection（当前页回环态、通用 RPC、活动代际及 Host 事实、可观察恢复状态、立即重连命令、代际源注册点）；代际在源报告 ready 时可见，完成/失败/撤回/显式停止即清除后由 ConnectionController 施加重试策略。", "tags": ["documentation", "connection", "rpc"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/client/connection/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection 包清单：Host/Client 双面连接包的依赖与导出（含 ./client 子路径）。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "type": "file", "name": "api-request-trust.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "summary": "每个 /api 请求的浏览器信任栅：防 DNS rebinding（Host 栅约束一切请求——明文 HTTP 下浏览器读请求不带 Origin/Fetch-Metadata，Host 是 rebinding 唯一伪造不了的头部）与恶意页跨站请求；非浏览器与远程客户端经回环、监听 bind IP 字面量或 trustedHosts 条目过同一栅；绑定策略属 webserver 配置，本栅不建立身份。", "tags": ["security-fence", "dns-rebinding", "trust-policy"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "trustedHosts 条目必须是规范裸 host[:port]：WHATWG 解析会静默改写的形态（路径/用户@、悬挂冒号、零填充端口、0x7f.0.0.1、未括 IPv6）一律拒载。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts:assertTrustedAuthority", "type": "function", "name": "assertTrustedAuthority", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "lineRange": [53, 57], "summary": "断言 trustedHosts 条目为规范裸 authority：经 WHATWG 解析再规范化后必须逐字存活，否则加载期报错。", "tags": ["validation", "canonical-form"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts:isTrustedAuthority", "type": "function", "name": "isTrustedAuthority", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "lineRange": [77, 85], "summary": "请求 authority 是否命中声明的 trustedHosts 条目（host 或 host:port 精确匹配）。", "tags": ["trust-check"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts:isRemoteAuthority", "type": "function", "name": "isRemoteAuthority", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "lineRange": [92, 95], "summary": "authority 是否为非回环的远程形态（供 allowsRemoteAuthorities 判定）。", "tags": ["remote-detection"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts:isBindAddressAuthority", "type": "function", "name": "isBindAddressAuthority", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "lineRange": [105, 111], "summary": "authority 是否为监听器自身 bind IP 字面量。", "tags": ["bind-address"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts:isTrustedApiRequest", "type": "function", "name": "isTrustedApiRequest", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "lineRange": [121, 151], "summary": "单请求准入判定：Host 栅先行（回环/bind IP/trustedHosts），再看浏览器标记（Origin/Fetch-Metadata 与 Sec-Fetch-Site）做同源/跨源区分。", "tags": ["request-admission", "host-fence"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts:isSameAuthorityOrigin", "type": "function", "name": "isSameAuthorityOrigin", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/api-request-trust.ts", "lineRange": [160, 176], "summary": "Origin 头是否与请求 authority 同源（同 host 同端口形态比较）。", "tags": ["origin-check"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/browser-auth.ts", "type": "file", "name": "browser-auth.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/browser-auth.ts", "summary": "进程启动 token 交换与持久签名 cookie 验证：BrowserAuth 持凭证 provider 的签名密钥做同步请求认证——authorizeIndex 上根查询 token 换 cookie 并 303 到干净 ./、有效 cookie 放行、其余一律同一最小 401；authorizeConnect 服务 /connect API 客户端交换；cookie 载荷签名+版本+audience 绑定。", "tags": ["browser-auth", "signed-cookie", "token-exchange"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "cookie 的 Secure 只由收请求监听器自身协议决定，永不看 publicUrl 宣告或转发头；maxAgeDays 超出安全时间戳范围即构造期报错。"},
  {"id": "class:packages/client/connection/src/browser-auth.ts:BrowserAuth", "type": "class", "name": "BrowserAuth", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/browser-auth.ts", "lineRange": [206, 394], "summary": "浏览器认证所有者：create 经凭证 provider 建持久签名密钥；authenticatedUrl 附进程启动 token；authorizeIndex/authorizeConnect/authenticateApi/authenticate 各入口共享 launchToken 校验与 cookie 签发/验证；writeUnauthorized 统一 401。", "tags": ["authentication", "cookie-lifecycle"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/client/api.ts", "type": "file", "name": "api.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/api.ts", "summary": "浏览器安全的 Connection 协议与共享应用值导出：重导出 RPC 消息类型/RpcId/transportError 与 SessionId/SessionEvent/MessageId/ContentBlock/StreamChunk，resultOf 取 RPC 应答的业务结果。", "tags": ["barrel", "browser-safe", "type-reexports"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/api.ts:resultOf", "type": "function", "name": "resultOf", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/api.ts", "lineRange": [23, 25], "summary": "取 RPC 应答携带的业务结果字段。", "tags": ["unwrap"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/client/connection.ts", "type": "file", "name": "connection.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/connection.ts", "summary": "连接生命周期控制：ConnectionController 打开已注册的代际源并在丢失时指数退避重连（代际/尝试态为实例私有绝不进 store，sink 异常不杀代际循环）；reconnect 重置尝试序列并立即换源，setNetworkAvailable 反映浏览器网络可用性。", "tags": ["connection-controller", "reconnect", "exponential-backoff"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "class:packages/client/connection/src/client/connection.ts:ConnectionController", "type": "class", "name": "ConnectionController", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/connection.ts", "lineRange": [77, 285], "summary": "代际循环拥有者：start/stop 幂等、reconnect 以 MANUAL_RECONNECT 中止当前代际与退避延迟、backoffDelay 按 base*factor^attempt 封顶、loop 在源结束后按延迟重开新代际并通知 onReconnectRequested。", "tags": ["lifecycle", "retry-policy"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/connection.ts:waitForReady", "type": "function", "name": "waitForReady", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/connection.ts", "lineRange": [288, 323], "summary": "等待代际源 ready 报告：带慢握手告警与硬超时（generationReadyWarnMs/generationReadyTimeoutMs），超时不取消握手。", "tags": ["readiness-wait", "timeouts"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts", "summary": "Client 插件入口：installConnection 从显式组合输入装一个 Context 拥有的 Connection 服务——rpc 默认 createWebConnectionRpc、代际/状态双订阅通知（listener 异常 console.error 不中断）、ConnectionHandle 暴露 openWebSocket/isLoopback/rpc/reconnect/registerGenerationSource。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "service-installation", "subscribers"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts:watchBrowserNetwork", "type": "function", "name": "watchBrowserNetwork", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts", "lineRange": [208, 221], "summary": "订阅浏览器 online/offline 事件驱动 setNetworkAvailable（返回取消函数）。", "tags": ["network-watch", "browser-events"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts:installConnection", "type": "function", "name": "installConnection", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts", "lineRange": [228, 337], "summary": "装配连接服务：代际源就绪后建 ConnectionOwner（controller+network watch），handle 上发布代际/状态快照订阅；源完成/失败/撤回即释放 owner 并清态；重复注册代际源抛错。", "tags": ["installation", "generation-lifecycle"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/index.ts", "lineRange": [343, 352], "summary": "Client 插件 apply：以默认选项 installConnection。", "tags": ["plugin-entry"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/client/rpc.ts", "type": "file", "name": "rpc.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/rpc.ts", "summary": "通用 Connection 单元 RPC 通道的浏览器调用方：createWebConnectionRpc 以 fetch（可注入传输）发 client-request 帧、随机 UUID 关联、应答包络校验；parseBinaryResponse/parseConnectionResponse 处理带二进制附件分离的应答。", "tags": ["rpc-client", "envelope-validation", "binary-attachments"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/rpc.ts:createWebConnectionRpc", "type": "function", "name": "createWebConnectionRpc", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/rpc.ts", "lineRange": [34, 81], "summary": "建浏览器 RPC 调用方：channel/endpoint 断言（路径字符白名单）、document-relative 路由发送、rpcId 关联与应答解包。", "tags": ["factory", "rpc-framing"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/rpc.ts:parseBinaryResponse", "type": "function", "name": "parseBinaryResponse", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/rpc.ts", "lineRange": [83, 139], "summary": "解析带分离二进制附件的 RPC 应答：按 path 把字节回填进 JSON 结果的占位 null。", "tags": ["parsing", "attachment-rebinding"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/client/socket.ts", "type": "file", "name": "socket.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/socket.ts", "summary": "浏览器/桌面/认证 Node 连接的物理 socket 选择：openConnectionWebSocket 把逻辑通道对显式 Host 基或页面 document base 解析为 ws/wss URL 并经可注入工厂建认证 socket，消费者自持帧与关闭。", "tags": ["websocket", "carrier-selection"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/client/socket.ts:openConnectionWebSocket", "type": "function", "name": "openConnectionWebSocket", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/client/socket.ts", "lineRange": [56, 66], "summary": "逻辑通道路径解析为绝对 ws(s) URL（https→wss）并开认证 socket；无 document 且未给 baseUrl 即抛错。", "tags": ["url-resolution", "websocket"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/connect-protocol.ts", "type": "file", "name": "connect-protocol.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/connect-protocol.ts", "summary": "Host 与客户端共享的 API 连接输入：ConnectionInteractions（answer/none）与 /connect 启动 token 交换路由常量。", "tags": ["shared-protocol", "constants"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/http-bridge.ts", "type": "file", "name": "http-bridge.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/http-bridge.ts", "summary": "/api 传输的 node:http↔WHATWG fetch 桥（host 侧）：bridge 把 node 请求桥到 fetch 形态 handler——客户端断开检测挂响应 close（Node 16 起 request close 在体耗尽即触发）而非 request、响应写遵守背压并在断连时停止；默认 300MiB 体上限按 200MiB 聚合图像 base64 扩张+包络余量定尺，桥在内存缓冲故同时是单请求驻留上界。", "tags": ["http-bridge", "backpressure", "body-cap"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/http-bridge.ts:bridge", "type": "function", "name": "bridge", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/http-bridge.ts", "lineRange": [37, 127], "summary": "单请求桥接：AbortController 跟随响应 close、缓冲有上限的请求体、把 fetch Response 流式写回 node 响应。", "tags": ["bridging", "streaming"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/index.ts", "summary": "Host 插件入口（inject credentials）：apply 建 HostConnectionService+BrowserAuth，trustedHosts 逐条 assertTrustedAuthority、断言体上限覆盖聚合图像 base64 需求；webServer 在场时挂 /api 前缀路由（admit 栅+connection/request 瀑布+bridge）与 /connect 精确路由，index-inject 注入 __DSH_CONNECTION_RECOVERY__ 恢复时序。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "route-mounting", "service-provider"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/index.ts:assertImageBodyCapacity", "type": "function", "name": "assertImageBodyCapacity", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [78, 90], "summary": "校验 maxRequestBodyBytes 至少覆盖聚合图像限制的 base64 扩张（4/3）+1MiB 包络余量，否则加载期报错。", "tags": ["capacity-check", "fail-loud"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [126, 169], "summary": "解析配置并建服务；webServer 子上下文注册 /api 与 /connect 路由及恢复注入；attachments 子上下文重跑容量断言。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "composition"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/peer.ts", "type": "file", "name": "peer.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/peer.ts", "summary": "Peer：被本 Host 准入的一方——创建者固定其 principal 并拥有生命周期，Gateway 以 invocation.peer 交给每个 Remote 调用；实例自身即 scope 键，经 peer.ctx 注册的监听只收到以该 Peer 为目标的派发。", "tags": ["peer", "scope", "principal"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "class:packages/client/connection/src/peer.ts:Peer", "type": "class", "name": "Peer", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/peer.ts", "lineRange": [26, 53], "summary": "PeerScope 实现：createScope(owner, this) 建 scope 上下文、interactions（answer/none）、effect 中止 lifetime signal；dispose 与 owner 卸载殊途同归，竞态调用共享一个完成。", "tags": ["scope-key", "lifetime"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/recovery-config.ts", "type": "file", "name": "recovery-config.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/recovery-config.ts", "summary": "Host 配置与浏览器本地恢复时序的共享校验：backoffBase/Factor/Max、generationReadyWarn/Timeout 五字段 schema（浏览器与 Node 共享 32 位定时器上限），resolveConnectionConfig 补全默认。", "tags": ["configuration", "recovery-timing"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/recovery-config.ts:resolveConnectionConfig", "type": "function", "name": "resolveConnectionConfig", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/recovery-config.ts", "lineRange": [38, 44], "summary": "校验恢复输入并补全全部时序默认，backoffFactor 非有限值抛 RangeError。", "tags": ["validation", "defaulting"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts", "type": "file", "name": "rpc-host.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts", "summary": "Host Connection 服务：HostConnectionService（Service 子类，ctx.connection）持有 Peer 注册表（browserPeer 为共享 owner principal）、通道 RPC 与 Fetch 路由注册（属调用方 fiber）、admit 请求栅、createSharedFetchHandler 产 fetch 形态 API 载体；rpcFetchHandler 处理通用 RPC 帧（channel/endpoint 白名单、rpcId 关联、附件分离）。", "tags": ["service-provider", "rpc-host", "peer-registry"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "class:packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts:HostConnectionService", "type": "class", "name": "HostConnectionService", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts", "lineRange": [70, 302], "summary": "核心 Host 服务：构造建 browserPeer 与卸载时全量 Peer dispose；admit/createPeer/publishPeer 准入与发布、authorizeConnect/authorizeIndex 走 BrowserAuth、requestRejection 供其他插件问信任栅、registerFetchRoute 注册精确 Fetch 路由；allowsRemoteAuthorities 供 directory-picker-auto 等读取。", "tags": ["service-provider", "admission", "fetch-routes"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts:rpcFetchHandler", "type": "function", "name": "rpcFetchHandler", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts", "lineRange": [304, 349], "summary": "通用 RPC fetch 处理：解析 client-request 帧、按 channel 找拦截器执行 handler、结果封 server-response（成功值与分离附件或错误包络）。", "tags": ["rpc-dispatch", "framing"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts:endpointFromPath", "type": "function", "name": "endpointFromPath", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc-host.ts", "lineRange": [361, 370], "summary": "从请求路径切出 channel 与 endpoint 段。", "tags": ["path-parsing"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/connection/src/rpc.ts", "type": "file", "name": "rpc.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc.ts", "summary": "Host 与 Client 共享的通用单元 RPC 契约：Branded RpcId 关联 id、ConnectionRpcResult ok/error 包络、ConnectionRpcAttachment（结果相对 path+JSON 占位 null 分离出的字节视图）、ConnectionFetchHandler 等载波中立类型与 transportError 归一。", "tags": ["type-definition", "rpc-contract", "branded-id"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/rpc.ts:RpcId", "type": "function", "name": "RpcId", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc.ts", "lineRange": [14, 16], "summary": "把已验证字符串品牌化为 RPC 关联 id。", "tags": ["branding"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/connection/src/rpc.ts:transportError", "type": "function", "name": "transportError", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/src/rpc.ts", "lineRange": [56, 65], "summary": "把被拒的传输操作归一为 gateway/internal 失败结果（保留可用消息）。", "tags": ["error-normalization"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/client/connection/tsconfig.client.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.client.json", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/tsconfig.client.json", "summary": "Client 面 TypeScript 配置：extends tsconfig.base.client.json、rootDir src、outDir lib/types，files 显式列举浏览器面源文件（Host/Client 双面分裂布局）。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "client-face"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/client/connection/tsconfig.host.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.host.json", "filePath": "packages/client/connection/tsconfig.host.json", "summary": "Host 面 TypeScript 配置：与 client 面相对的 Node 侧编译叶（solution-only 根聚合）。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "host-face"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/client/file-upload/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/README.md", "summary": "dsh-client-file-upload 包 README：浏览器特性为 Session 存 Blob/精确字节/ReadableStream 并收不透明回执供后续提示词——已服务页面经后台载体发送不在线程上聚合字节；Host 在另一执行上下文的页面在 Cordis 启动前供 Fetch 形态载体；可观察消费字节与取消；流体一次消费且跨 Worker 边界转所有权；图像上传暂存归一化提示图像。", "tags": ["documentation", "file-upload", "background-carrier"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/client/file-upload/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-file-upload 包清单：浏览器文件上传的依赖与导出（含 ./client 子路径）。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/contract.ts", "type": "file", "name": "contract.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/contract.ts", "summary": "浏览器侧上传契约类型：FileUploadBody（Blob|ReadableStream）、FileUploadProgress（单调字节进度）、FileUploadService（upload 存文件/uploadImage 存提示图像，均按 Session 身份寻址、返回 RemoteResult<FileUploadValue|ImageUploadValue>）。", "tags": ["type-definition", "service-contract"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/index.ts", "summary": "浏览器后台上传 Client 插件（inject remote）：apply 以 FileUploadRuntime 装载 ctx.fileUpload 服务。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "service-provider"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/index.ts", "lineRange": [24, 26], "summary": "ctx.plugin(FileUploadRuntime) 提供 fileUpload 服务。", "tags": ["plugin-entry"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts", "type": "file", "name": "runtime.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts", "summary": "Blob 与字节流体的后台浏览器上传实现：FileUploadRuntime（Service 子类，ctx.fileUpload）按全局钩子有无选 worker/自定义载体——Blob 走 Blob Worker 内 XHR（upload.onprogress 进度经 postMessage 回传）、一次性 ReadableStream 走 half-duplex fetch（所有权跨界转移）；精确字节走生成 Remote 回退；结果 parseUploadResult/fileUploadValue/imageUploadValue 严格校验。", "tags": ["background-upload", "worker-carrier", "progress-reporting"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "Worker 体以字符串形态成为 Blob Worker 源（自包含可注入 XHR/fetch）；ELECTRON 类跨执行上下文 Host 由页面在 Cordis 启动前供 __DSH_FILE_UPLOAD__ fetch 钩子。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts:fileUploadWorker", "type": "function", "name": "fileUploadWorker", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts", "lineRange": [80, 153], "summary": "自包含 Worker 体：Blob 走 XHR 带进度上报，ReadableStream 走 duplex:half fetch，结果/错误以 progress/complete/error 消息回传。", "tags": ["worker-body", "xhr-progress"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts:customTransport", "type": "function", "name": "customTransport", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts", "lineRange": [258, 272], "summary": "用页面注入的 Fetch 形态钩子构造载体（跨执行上下文 Host 场景）。", "tags": ["transport", "custom-hook"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts:workerTransport", "type": "function", "name": "workerTransport", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts", "lineRange": [274, 332], "summary": "构造 Blob Worker 载体：把 fileUploadWorker 字符串体化为 Worker、请求 postMessage 进/进度消息出、结束即 terminate。", "tags": ["worker-transport", "lifecycle"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts:parseUploadResult", "type": "function", "name": "parseUploadResult", "filePath": "packages/client/file-upload/src/client/runtime.ts", "lineRange": [334, 351], "summary": "校验上传路由的 JSON 应答（状态/体形状），产出业务结果或错误。", "tags": ["validation"], "complexity": "simple"},
